{
  "id": "ISA.29",
  "number": "29",
  "bookId": "ISA",
  "reference": "Isaiah 29",
  "verseCount": 24,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "29",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "ISA 29"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "29",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 29:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "God's altar, Jerusalem itself, is doomed! The city where David camped is doomed! Let another year or two come and go, with its feasts and festivals, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.29.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.29.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 29:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and then God will bring disaster on the city that is called “God's altar”. There will be weeping and wailing, and the whole city will be like an altar covered with blood. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.29.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.29.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 29:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "God will attack the city, surround it, and besiege it. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.29.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.29.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 29:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jerusalem will be like a ghost struggling to speak from under the ground, a muffled voice coming from the dust.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.29.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.29.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 29:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.29.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.29.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 29:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jerusalem, all the foreigners who attack you will be blown away like dust, and their terrifying armies will fly away like straw. Suddenly and unexpectedly ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.29.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.29.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 29:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.29.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.29.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " Almighty will rescue you with violent thunderstorms and earthquakes. He will send tempests and raging fire; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.29.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.29.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 29:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "then all the armies of the nations attacking the city of God's altar, all their weapons and equipment — everything — will vanish like a dream, like something imagined in the night. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.29.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.29.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 29:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "All the nations that assemble to attack Jerusalem will be like a starving person who dreams he is eating and wakes up hungry, or like someone dying of thirst who dreams he is drinking and wakes with a dry throat.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.29.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.29.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 29:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.29.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.29.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 29:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Go ahead and be stupid! Go ahead and be blind! Get drunk without any wine! Stagger without drinking a drop! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.29.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.29.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 29:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ROM.11.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Rom 11.8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.29.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.29.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " has made you drowsy, ready to fall into a deep sleep. The prophets should be the eyes of the people, but God has blindfolded them. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.29.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.29.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 29:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The meaning of every prophetic vision will be hidden from you; it will be like a sealed scroll. If you take it to someone who knows how to read and ask him to read it to you, he will say he can't because it is sealed. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.29.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.29.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 29:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If you give it to someone who can't read and ask him to read it to you, he will answer that he doesn't know how.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.29.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.29.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 29:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.29.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.29.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 29:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.29.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.29.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.15.8+MAT.15.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mt 15.8–9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MRK.7.6+MRK.7.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mk 7.6–7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The Lord said, “These people claim to worship me, but their words are meaningless, and their hearts are somewhere else. Their religion is nothing but human rules and traditions, which they have simply memorized. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.29.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.29.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 29:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CO.1.19"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Cor 1.19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So I will startle them with one unexpected blow after another. Those who are wise will turn out to be fools, and all their cleverness will be useless.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.29.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.29.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 29:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.29.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.29.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 29:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Those who try to hide their plans from the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.29.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.29.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " are doomed! They carry out their schemes in secret and think no one will see them or know what they are doing. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.29.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.29.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 29:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.45.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Is 45.9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They turn everything upside down. Which is more important, the potter or the clay? Can a thing which someone has made say to its maker, “You didn't make me”? Or “You don't know what you are doing”?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.29.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.29.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 29:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.29.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.29.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 29:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "As the saying goes, before long the dense forest will become farmland, and the farmland will go back to forest.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.29.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.29.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 29:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.29.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.29.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 29:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When that day comes, the deaf will be able to hear a book being read aloud, and the blind, who have been living in darkness, will open their eyes and see. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.29.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.29.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 29:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Poor and humble people will once again find the happiness which the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.29.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.29.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", the holy God of Israel, gives. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.29.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.29.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 29:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "It will be the end of those who oppress others and show contempt for God. Every sinner will be destroyed. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.29.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.29.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 29:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "God will destroy those who slander others, those who prevent the punishment of criminals, and those who tell lies to keep honest men from getting justice.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.29.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.29.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 29:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.29.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.29.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 29:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So now the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.29.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.29.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", the God of Israel, who rescued Abraham from trouble, says, “My people, you will not be disgraced any longer, and your faces will no longer be pale with shame. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.29.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.29.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 29:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When you see the children that I will give you, then you will acknowledge that I am the holy God of Israel. You will honour me and stand in awe of me. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.29.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.29.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 29:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Foolish people will learn to understand, and those who are always grumbling will be glad to be taught.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.29.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.29.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
